# Keep git from guessing. A raw NUL byte in a .ts file once made metrics.ts
# classify as binary, so its diff printed "Bin ... bytes" and the change merged
# unreviewed. `text` normalises line endings; `diff` forces a textual diff even
# if a stray control byte gets in again, so the next one cannot hide.
*.ts text diff
*.tsx text diff
*.json text diff
*.md text diff
